      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Yes, for one week. So, as for chest pain, honestly, a few times a day. I've been feeling faint too, for about a month. I've also had a racing heart. About racing heart, moderate, I'd say.",
